000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TMNPARCD.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        11/20/84.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.      MANUFACTURER/MANUFACTURER PART NUMBER INQUIRY
001000*              SUBPROGRAM.  GIVEN A CORPORATE CODE, THIS SUBPROGRAM
001100*              RETURNS THE FIRST MANUFACTURER AND MANUFACTURER'S
001200*              PART NUMBER FOR THAT CODE.  CORPORATE CODE PASSED
001300*              IS ALSO VALIDATED.
001400*
001500*  PARAMETERS
001600*  ----------
001700*  RET-CODE           X(2).  "NF" IS RETURNED IF CORP-CODE DOES
001800*                     NOT EXIST.  "BU" IS RETURNED IF FATAL ERROR.
001900*                     "00" IS RETURNED IF SUCCESSFUL EXECUTION.
002000*
002100*  CALL-MODE          MODES PASSED FROM MAIN PROGRAM MEAN:
002200*
002300*                       1  -  VALIDATE CORP CODE ONLY
002400*                       2  -  VALIDATE CODE AND GET MANUF./
002500*                             MANUF. PART NO
002600*                       3  -  VALIDATE CODE AND GET KEYWORD/
002700*                             ADJECTIVE
002800*                       4  -  VALIDATE CODE AND GET BOTH MANUF./
002900*                             MANUF. PART NOT AND KEYWORD/ADJECTIVE.
003000*
003100*  BASE               BASE PARM OF OPENED STORES DATABASE IS
003200*                     PASSED
003300*
003400*  STATUS-AREA        ALL DATABASE STATUS WORDS ARE RETURNED
003500*
003600*  CORP-CODE          CORP CODE ABOUT WHICH INFORMATION IS WANTED
003700*                     IS PASSED.
003800*
003900*  MANUFACTURER       FIRST MANUFACTURER FOUND FOR THAT CODE
004000*                     IS RETURNED IF MODE 2 OR 4 IS PASSED.
004100*
004200*  PARTNO             MANUFACTURER'S PART NUMBER FOR THAT CODE
004300*                     IS RETURNED IF MODE 2 OR 4 IS PASSED.
004400*
004500*  KEYWORD            KEYWORD OF PASSED CODE RETURNED IF MODE 3 OR 4.
004600*
004700*  ADJECTIVE          ADJECTIVE RETURNED IF MODE 3 OR 4.
004800*
004900*
005000**************************************************************
005100*   PROGRAM CHANGES:                                         *
005200**************************************************************
005300*   11/05/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
005400*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
005500*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
005600*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
005700*   11/05/85  CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
005800*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
005900*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
006000*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
006100*                           -TW COTTON                       *
006200*                                                            *
006300*   11/05/85  CONVERTED PROGRAM TO COPYLIB.                  *
006400*                            D.A. PLUM                       *
      *                                                            *
      *C  09/16/1996   CA YODER                                    *
      *C  RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES. *
      *C                                                           *
006500**************************************************************
006600
006700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
006800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
006900 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007000 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DMANPART-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

007300
007400 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  DMANPART-CD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DMANPART-CD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3600  OF MCFLCS3603.

       FD  DDESC-CD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC-CD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1400  OF MCFLCS1401.

       FD  MSTORERM-CD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-CD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

007500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
007600
007700 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
007700     05  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1        PIC X(80).
007900
008000**************************************************************
008100**                                                          **
008200**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
008300**                                                          **
008400**************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
008500
008600 01  DSET-NAMES.
008700     05  DSET-DMANPART          PIC X(10) VALUE "DMANPART;".
008800     05  DSET-DDESC             PIC X(6)  VALUE "DDESC;".
008900
009000 01  MODE-AREA.
009100     05  MODE1                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
009200     05  MODE3                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
009300     05  MODE5                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
009400     05  MODE7                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
009500
009600 01  ALL-ITEM-LIST              PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
009700
009800 01  CODE-SEARCH                PIC X(10) VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
009900
       COPY BUMSG IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
010000
010100**************************************************************
010200**                                                          **
010300**           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
010400**                                                          **
010500**************************************************************
010600
       COPY MSTORERM IN COPYLIB.
010700 COPY DMANPART IN COPYLIB.
010900 COPY DDESC    IN COPYLIB.
011000
011100**************************************************************
011200**                                                          **
011300**            L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N                 **
011400**                                                          **
011500**************************************************************
011600
011700 LINKAGE SECTION.
011800
011900 01  RET-CODE                   PIC X(2).
012000 01  CALL-MODE                  PIC S9(4) BINARY.
012100 01  BASE                       PIC X(10).
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
012900
013000 01  CODE-ARG                   PIC X(8).
013100
013200 01  MNPARCD-RET-DATA.
013300     05  MANUFACTURER           PIC X(26).
013400     05  PARTNO                 PIC X(20).
013500     05  KEYWORD-ADJECTIVE.
013600         10  KEYWORD            PIC X(20).
013700         10  ADJECTIVE          PIC X(30).
013800
013900 COPY LANGSUB   IN COPYLIB.
014000
014100
014200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING RET-CODE,
                                CALL-MODE,
                                BASE,
                                STATUS-AREA,
                                CODE-ARG,
                                MNPARCD-RET-DATA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.
014400
014500 6000-MAIN.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
014600     MOVE "00"  TO  RET-CODE.
014700     MOVE SPACES TO KEYWORD, ADJECTIVE, MANUFACTURER, PARTNO.
014800
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MSTORERM-CD-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
               MOVE "NF" TO RET-CODE
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

014900     IF CALL-MODE = 1
015000         GO TO 6990-MAIN-X
015100     ELSE
015200     IF CALL-MODE = 2
015300         PERFORM 6100-FIND-DMANPART THRU 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X
015400     ELSE
015500     IF CALL-MODE = 3
015600         PERFORM 6200-FIND-DDESC  THRU 6290-FIND-DDESC-X
015700     ELSE
015800     IF CALL-MODE = 4
015900         PERFORM 6100-FIND-DMANPART THRU 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X
016000         IF RET-CODE NOT = "BU"
016100             PERFORM 6200-FIND-DDESC THRU 6290-FIND-DDESC-X.
016200
016300     GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.
016400
018200 6100-FIND-DMANPART.
           PERFORM 9999-DBFIND-DMANPART-CD-I.
018500     IF NO-ENTRY
018600         MOVE "NF"       TO  RET-CODE
018700         GO TO 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X
018800     ELSE
018900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
019000         MOVE "BU"       TO  RET-CODE
019100         GO TO 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X.
019200
020400 6110-GET-DMANPART.
020500*---------- THIS SUBPROGRAM RETURNS ONLY THE FIRST MANUFACTURER
020600*---------- AND MANUFACTURER'S PART NUMBER FOUND FOR THE CODE
020700
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET5-DMANPART-CD-I.
021000     IF END-OF-CHAIN
021100*        *** NO MANUFACTURERS ON FILE ***
021200         MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM
021300         MOVE  13 TO LANG-MSGNUM
021400         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
021500         IF RET-CODE NOT = "BU"
021600             MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MANUFACTURER
021700             GO TO 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X
021800         ELSE
021900             GO TO 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X
022000     ELSE
022100     IF NO-ENTRY
022200         MOVE "BU"   TO  RET-CODE
022300         GO TO 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X.
022400
022500     MOVE MAN-NAME        TO MANUFACTURER.
022600     MOVE MAN-PARTNO      TO PARTNO.
022700
022800 6190-FIND-DMANPART-X.
022900     EXIT.
023000
023100
023200 6200-FIND-DDESC.
           PERFORM 9999-DBFIND-DDESC-CD-I.
023500     IF NO-ENTRY
023600         MOVE "NF"                 TO  RET-CODE
023700         GO TO 6290-FIND-DDESC-X
023800     ELSE
023900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
024000         MOVE "BU"                 TO  RET-CODE
024100         GO TO 6290-FIND-DDESC-X.
024200
025400 6210-GET-DDESC.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET5-DDESC-CD-I.
025700     IF END-OF-CHAIN
025800*        *** NO DESCRIPTION ON FILE ***
025900         MOVE  14 TO LANG-SETNUM
026000         MOVE   3 TO LANG-MSGNUM
026100         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
026200         IF RET-CODE NOT = "BU"
026300             MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KEYWORD-ADJECTIVE
026400             GO TO 6290-FIND-DDESC-X
026500         ELSE
026600             GO TO 6290-FIND-DDESC-X
026700     ELSE
026800     IF NO-ENTRY
026900         MOVE "BU"                       TO  RET-CODE
027000         GO TO 6290-FIND-DDESC-X.
027100
027200     MOVE DESC-KW                       TO  KEYWORD
027300     MOVE DESC-MOD                      TO  ADJECTIVE.
027400
027500 6290-FIND-DDESC-X.
027600     EXIT.
027700
027800 6990-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
027900     GOBACK.
028000
       2100-BLOWUP.
           GOBACK.

       COPY HCATREAD IN COPYLIB.

       9930-LOCK.
       9940-UNLOCK.
       9999-DBFIND-DMANPART-CD-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DMANPART-CD-REC-I.
           START DMANPART-CD-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DMANPART-CD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF (FILE-STATUS NOT = "00") AND (FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2")
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.

       9999-DBGET5-DMANPART-CD-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DMANPART-CD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DMANPART
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF CORPCDE OF DMANPART-CD-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.

       9999-DBFIND-DDESC-CD-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF DDESC-CD-REC-I.
           START DDESC-CD-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DDESC-CD-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF (FILE-STATUS NOT = "00") AND (FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2")
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.

       9999-DBGET5-DDESC-CD-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DDESC-CD-I NEXT INTO BUF-DDESC
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF CORPCDE OF DDESC-CD-REC-I NOT = CODE-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.

       9999-DBGET7-MSTORERM-CD-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-CD-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-CD-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET7 ERR 9999-DBGET7-MSTORERM-CD-I"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN INPUT DMANPART-CD-I         DDESC-CD-I           .
           OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-CD-I.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE      DMANPART-CD-I         DDESC-CD-I           .
           CLOSE      MSTORERM-CD-I.
